From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:24:26 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] The 3D video settings say beside a way that needs more of the
 GPU's memory than is free (ORDER 411, step 2g)

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 via Claude Code
Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/qml/PlayerPage.qml | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/qml/PlayerPage.qml b/src/qml/PlayerPage.qml
index ec4624e..f5f358e 100644
--- a/src/qml/PlayerPage.qml
+++ b/src/qml/PlayerPage.qml
@@ -202,6 +202,11 @@ Please <link url="%1">contact the %2 developers</link> about this issue, or to f
             function onStereoDepthChoiceChanged() {
                 depthSettings.setChoice(video.stereoDepthChoice)
             }
+            // What the GPU that draws has free: a way that would not fit says so beside its name in the lists, before it is picked (and
+            // runs when it is picked)
+            function onStereoDepthGpuMemoryChanged() {
+                depthSettings.setGpuMemory(video.stereoDepthGpuMemory)
+            }
         }
 
         Dragon.StereoSettings {
